  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Productive and Tourism Infrastructure Program for the Province of Ro Negro</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura Productiva y Turstica de la Provincia de Ro Negro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Consolidar el proceso de desarrollo de los sectores productivo y turstico a travs del fortalecimiento y expansin de la infraestructura econmica pblica y las buenas prcticas de manejo aplicadas en su gestin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&apos;s goals are to consolidate the productive and tourism sectors development, through the strengthening and expansion of the public economic infrastructure and the good practices applied in their management.</narrative>
  </description>
